  <bioghist id="f9958dee11cd5cb13882a5268e227b1e">
    <head>Biographical / Historical</head>
<p>Irwin Taylor Sanders (1909-2005) was a sociologist and educator. He worked for several years as Associate Director of the Ford Foundation's International Training and Research Program.</p>  </bioghist>
